## Title: GaarXPForever
## Notes: XP at a glance on WoW Forever: a small movable panel with XP, rested XP, XP per hour, time to level and kills/quests to level; text on the XP bar; time played per level on level-up; quest XP in tooltips. Every part can be switched off. /gxp
